5 0 obj
<< /Length 488 >>
stream
BT /F1 14 Tf 72 720 Td (1.1 Geometric Meaning) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 680 Td (The absolute value of the determinant equals the volume of the parallelepiped.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 650 Td (Theorem: a square matrix is invertible if and only if its determinant is non zero.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 620 Td (Proof: if the determinant is non zero the reduced row echelon form is the identity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 580 Td (Figure 1-1 shows the area interpretation for two by two matrices.) Tj ET
endstream
