BT /F1 18 Tf 72 720 Td (Chapter 2 Matrices) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 680 Td (A matrix is a rectangular array of numbers arranged in rows and columns.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 650 Td (Definition: the identity matrix has ones on the diagonal and zeros elsewhere.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 620 Td (Theorem: the product of two invertible matrices is invertible.) Tj ET
endstream
